# HB-SAMPLE (CROSS-PORT): Melee Mars ThrowHi (retail data from the vanilla disc), retargeted by bone role; owner choice: owner 2026-10-11 (tentative, to compare): Marth's up throw on Goku's bones.
# Hitbox joint, size and offsets are Mars's moved to Goku's bone of the same role (a sphere on the root joint is scaled about it) and scaled by the size ratio 0.9996 (script units: build.py multiplies by 1.4286; the engine then applies Goku's built size 1.2 to the fighter, model and hitboxes alike). Damage, angle, KBG/BKB, timing, auto-cancel and IASA are unchanged; left behind: gfx, sfx.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
smash_sfx
throw slot=0 damage=4 angle=93 kbg=130 fkb=0 bkb=60 element=0 sfx_severity=2 sfx_kind=2
throw slot=1 damage=3 angle=361 kbg=100 fkb=0 bkb=40 element=0 sfx_severity=0 sfx_kind=2
wait_until 12
throw_release
